{
  "title": "Namaz e Maghferat e Waaledain",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "This prayer for the parents is of two units. In the first unit, recite [Surah al-Faatehah](A5) once, then repeat the following supplication ten times:\nرَبِّ اغْفِرْلِىْ وَ لِوَالِدَىَّ وَ لِلْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ يَوْمَ يَقُوْمُ الْحِسَابُ\nRABBIGH FIR LEE WA LE WAALEDAYYA WA LIL MO'MENEENA YAWMA YAQOOMUL HESAAB\nO my Lord! Grant protection to me and my parents and the believers, on the day when the reckoning shall come to pass!\nIn the second unit, recite [Surah al-Faatehah](A5) once, then repeat the following supplication ten times:\nرَبِّ اغْفِرْلِىْ وَ لِوَالِدَىَّ وَ لِمَنْ دَخَلَ بَيْتِىَ مُؤْمِنًا وَّ لِلْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَ الْمُؤْمِنَاتِ\nRABBIGH FIR LEE WA LE WAALEDAYYA WA LEMAN DHAKHALA BAYTEE MO'MENAWN WA LIL MO'MENEENA WAL MO'MENAAT\nMy Lord! Forgive me and my parents and him who enters my house believing, and the believing men and the believing women.\nWhen the prayer is completed (after the Taslim), repeat the following supplication ten times:\nرَبِّ ارْحَمْهُمَا كَمَا رَبَّيَانِىْ صَغِيْرًا\nRABBIR HAM-HOMAA KAMAA RABBAYAANEE SAGHEERAA\nO my Lord! Have compassion on them, as they brought me up when I was little."
}
